    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, i've talked to people. i've tried the groups. it doesn't change the fact that i just keep failing. it feels like no matter what i do, the end result is always the same. i'm just so tired of the constant battle. it feels pointless like there's no real way to actually fix it, just more ways to try and fail again.",
